lmms-web: What a web page can't do is left out of the web build: starting other programs
(QProcess, for the GUI's "show in file manager") and sharing memory with them (the
song position shared with VST plugins).

Applies to LMMS v1.3.0-alpha.2 (GPL-2.0-or-later).

diff --git a/src/core/VstSyncController.cpp b/src/core/VstSyncController.cpp
index 715c630..30f1522 100644
--- a/src/core/VstSyncController.cpp
+++ b/src/core/VstSyncController.cpp
@@ -39,6 +39,10 @@ namespace lmms
 
 VstSyncController::VstSyncController()
 {
+#ifdef LMMS_BUILD_WEB
+	// No VST plugins in the web build, so nothing to share the song position with
+	return;
+#endif
 	try
 	{
 		m_syncData.create();
